#: ../../md/index.rst:2
msgid "分子シミュレーション"
msgstr "Molecular Simulation"

#: ../../md/index.rst:4
msgid "原子の運動を計算する方法と、軌跡から構造や相の変化、原子の拡散を読み取る方法を学びます。拡散の温度依存性を、1回の移動で越えるエネルギー障壁と結びつけて考えます。"
msgstr ""
"Learn how to simulate atomic motion and read trajectories to identify "
"changes in structure and phase, as well as atomic diffusion. Relate the "
"temperature dependence of diffusion to the energy barrier an atom crosses"
" in a single hop."

